# Files the delivery script drops into the working tree. They are untracked and
# large; git must never try to stash or clean them. apply.bat is the reason this
# block exists: `git stash -u` deleted the script while Windows was still
# reading it line-by-line, which killed the run at its first step.
apply.bat
apply-log.txt
phase*.bundle
apk.part*
royal-test.apk
